Third-party artwork
-------------------

The GoTree logo and the app icons derived from it (assets/, web/public/)
build on the Go gopher, designed by Renée French
(https://reneefrench.blogspot.com/). The Go gopher is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The gopher was redrawn
and placed into the tree for the logo.
